      "note": "370 W (max.) on the hardware version 4 datasheet. 802.3af/802.3at PSE, end-span, 1/2(+) 3/6(-), 30 W max a port at 54 V DC. PoE is port 1-24 only - the four TP/SFP combo cages are data-only. PD budget: 24 units at 7 W and at 15.4 W, 12 units at 30 W - the 370 W ceiling, not 24 x 30 W."
