    "fabric": {
      "capacityMbps": 56000,
      "kind": "switching fabric",
      "note": "56 Gbps non-blocking fabric and 41.67 Mpps at 64 bytes, 16K MAC table, 4.1 Mbit buffer, 12K jumbo frames. 28 physical ports x 2 Gbps full duplex, counting each TP/SFP combo pair once whichever medium is fitted."
    },
    "sourceUrl": "https://www.planet.com.tw/en/product/gs-4210-24p4c_gs-4210-24pl4c-v4",
    "notes": "Hardware version 4 datasheet (GS-4210-24P4C/24PL4C, v4). Ports 1-24 are PoE+ RJ45; ports 25-28 are Gigabit TP/SFP combo cages, modelled as an RJ45 and an SFP sharing one physical cage. RJ45 console at 115200 8-N-1. 2 smart fans, 440 x 207 x 44 mm, 2.7 kg, 443 W max fully loaded. Discrepancy: this model name has carried three PoE budgets across hardware revisions - 220 W on the original datasheet (C-GS-4210-24P4C_s.pdf), 280 W in the GS-4210 Series Quick Installation Guide v1.11, and 370 W on the current hardware v3/v4 datasheet - because the supply changed. The current v4 figure is modelled."
